/// comma-separated glob patterns in [raw] — the `DMTOOLS_FILE_READ_ALLOWED_PATHS`
/// value — after each pattern's literal prefix is resolved against
/// [workingDir] (Java `FileTools.isAllowedByConfig` parity, gh-367).
