     *       {@code {}, {@code [}).</li>
     *   <li>Extract the literal prefix (up to the last {@code /} before the wildcard)
     *       and the glob suffix (from that {@code /} onward).</li>
     *   <li>Resolve the literal prefix relative to {@code workingDir} to obtain an
